1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,740
This is Jeri, live, with a fictional email. Gemini reads
it once.

2
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:11,370
It returns your ask, with the exact sentences as
evidence.

3
00:00:11,912 --> 00:00:14,545
Code, not the AI, checks the dates.

4
00:00:14,585 --> 00:00:20,451
Wednesday the twelfth is really a Thursday, and the
deadline falls after the interview.

5
00:00:20,491 --> 00:00:22,192
Jeri does not guess.

6
00:00:23,433 --> 00:00:26,153
Listen reads it aloud.

7
00:00:28,631 --> 00:00:33,351
[App voice] You need to reply to this email or fill out the form.

8
00:00:33,465 --> 00:00:36,195
[App voice] Aiko Sato invited you to a second-round interview for
the Northbridge internship.

9
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:41,220
Captions stops the audio, and shows the same sentence.

10
00:00:43,655 --> 00:00:48,215
Easy Read uses plain cards, and keeps every 'not'.

11
00:00:48,856 --> 00:00:54,896
The draft asks which day they mean. Approve means
approved, not sent.
